   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# Contoh 1.18 – Least Squares untuk Sistem Overdetermined\n",
    "\n",
    "Misalkan sistem persamaan:\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "A =\n",
    "\\begin{bmatrix}\n",
    "1 & 1 \\\\\n",
    "1 & 2 \\\\\n",
    "1 & 3\n",
    "\\end{bmatrix}, \\quad\n",
    "\\mathbf{b} =\n",
    "\\begin{bmatrix}\n",
    "1 \\\\\n",
    "2 \\\\\n",
    "2\n",
    "\\end{bmatrix}\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "Karena jumlah persamaan lebih banyak dari jumlah variabel ($M > N$), kita cari solusi **Least Squares**.\n",
    "\n",
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "## Solusi Least Squares\n",
    "\n",
    "Gunakan rumus:\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\mathbf{x}^o = (A^T A)^{-1} A^T \\mathbf{b}\n",
    "\\tag{1.3.24}\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "## Perhitungan Manual (Opsional)\n",
    "\n",
    "1. Hitung $A^T A$ dan $A^T \\mathbf{b}$:\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "A^T A =\n",
    "\\begin{bmatrix}\n",
    "3 & 6 \\\\\n",
    "6 & 14\n",
    "\\end{bmatrix}, \\quad\n",
    "A^T \\mathbf{b} =\n",
    "\\begin{bmatrix}\n",
    "5 \\\\\n",
    "11\n",
    "\\end{bmatrix}\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "2. Invers dan hasil:\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\mathbf{x}^o = (A^T A)^{-1} A^T \\mathbf{b} =\n",
    "\\begin{bmatrix}\n",
    "0.6667 \\\\\n",
    "0.5\n",
    "\\end{bmatrix}\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "## Proyeksi ke $\\hat{\\mathbf{b}}$\n",
    "\n",
    "Hasil aproksimasi (prediksi) dari $A \\mathbf{x}^o$:\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\hat{\\mathbf{b}} =\n",
    "A \\mathbf{x}^o =\n",
    "\\begin{bmatrix}\n",
    "1.1667 \\\\\n",
    "1.6667 \\\\\n",
    "2.1667\n",
    "\\end{bmatrix}\n",
    "$$"
   ]
  },
